{
  "headline": "FDA's shortage list shows methotrexate injection has been in shortage since 2023-03-13 across multiple manufacturers; our three sites hold 15–19 days on hand",
  "headline_cites": ["E34", "D1", "D2", "D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the methotrexate sodium injection shortage on 2023-03-13 and it remains current as of 2026-10-21, spanning 43 months.",
      "cites": ["E34", "E29", "E30", "E31", "E32", "E33", "D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The shortage covers Accord Healthcare Inc., Fresenius Kabi USA LLC, Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc., Hospira Inc. (a Pfizer Company), and Teva Pharmaceuticals USA Inc.",
      "cites": ["E29", "E30", "E31", "E32", "E33"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 202 units at 12.5 units per day (16 days on hand), Corvale General holds 173 units at 11.8 units per day (15 days on hand), and Corvale Lakeside holds 16 units at 0.8 units per day (19 days on hand).",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Label records name manufacturing plants for Hikma (THYMOORGAN PHARMAZIE GmbH), Teva (PHARMACHEMIE BV), and Elite Laboratories Inc. (FEI 3002644678), but the links are weak or the plants could not be placed.",
      "cites": ["E10", "E11", "E22"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Elite Laboratories Inc. received an OAI classification on 2016-02-02 (inspection 961406) and a Warning Letter on 2016-08-25; its most recent inspection on 2025-08-01 was VAI.",
      "cites": ["E15", "E21", "E20"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Zydus Lifesciences Limited (FEI 3007938603) shows a series of VAI inspections, most recently 2023-03-24 (inspection 1204321), which ended 11 days after FDA posted the shortage.",
      "cites": ["E27", "E28", "D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alembic Pharmaceuticals Inc. is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place; check its supply status and plant registration before purchasing.",
      "cites": ["E10", "E11", "E22", "E28"]
    }
  ]
}
